  "instructions": [
    "Heat butter in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add chopped onion, mushroom, carrot, and zucchini to the skillet. Cook until the vegetables are tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add khao khua to the skillet and stir to combine with the vegetables.",
    "Add yuzu juice, salt, and black pepper to the skillet. Stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, stirring frequently.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley and chopped walnuts if desired."
